# Concise edits

- Be extremely concise. Do not explain basic programming concepts.
- Prefer diffs and surgical edits. Change only the lines, functions, or blocks that must change.
- Do not rewrite an entire file unless explicitly asked, or the file is so broken that a full rewrite is the only reliable fix.
- Skip recap of unchanged code. State what changed in one short sentence when needed.
